      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the augmented matrix $U,$ given by\n\n$$\nU=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & 8 & 0 \\\\ -9 & -4 & 6 \\\\ -5 & 6 & 3\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nWhat matrix results from carrying out the row operation $R_{1}\\leftrightarrow R_{3}$ on $U?$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "The operation $R_{1}\\leftrightarrow R_{3}$ means that we need to swap the first and third rows.\n\nApplying this row operation, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U &= \\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & 8 & 0 \\\\ -9 & -4 & 6 \\\\ -5 & 6 & 3\\end{array}\\right]\\,R_{1}\\leftrightarrow R_{3} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-5 & 6 & 3 \\\\ -9 & -4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 8 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
